{%- comment -%}
  Decides whether the visitor may see prices and buy:
  any product tagged with the public price tag (merch), or, for everything
  else, a customer on a B2B company or carrying the approved trade tag.
  Accepts: product (optional)
  Outputs "true" when allowed, so callers capture it:
  {% capture trade_access %}{% render 'trade-access', product: product %}{% endcapture %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign trade_access = false
  if product and product.tags contains settings.public_price_tag
    assign trade_access = true
  elsif customer
    if customer.b2b?
      assign trade_access = true
    elsif customer.tags contains settings.trade_tag
      assign trade_access = true
    endif
  endif
  if trade_access
    echo 'true'
  endif
-%}
